    "image_with_text_7tNUwQ": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_mRz8Ek": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>THE DENIM COLLECTION</strong></p><p>Handcrafted in Japan by skilled artisans, we use the highest quality Japanese denim and time-honored techniques, upholding responsible manufacturing methods that honor both people and the environment. Each piece is meticulously crafted, undergoing nearly 100 steps to produce one garment.</p><p>All of our denim is 100% cotton, with thoughtful touches, like contrast topstitching, hand-tacked embroidery instead of rivets to optimize softness, and adjustable waistbands and straps for long-wear and the perfect fit. Crafted entirely from cotton, our denim has no stretch — yet remains soft with a great hand-feel and is effortlessly versatile.</p><p>Designed for comfort and made for long wear — this denim can be worn often, worn in, and passed down.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_mRz8Ek"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/MP_SP25_Denim_Detail.jpg",
